(How this report is worked out) Tj
/F2 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 269 Tm
(Fits. ) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 72 269 Tm
(A resource's fit is direct when an offering of the target serves its taxonomy category and offers every capability the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 257 Tm
(resource uses, partial when the offering serving the category lacks some of them, and none when no offering serves the ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 245 Tm
(category or the resource is not classified.) Tj
/F2 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 230 Tm
(Best offering. ) Tj
/F1 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 111 230 Tm
(Every offering that serves the category is a candidate. Candidates are ordered direct before partial, then by ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 218 Tm
(how few capabilities they lack, then by name; the first is the best offering. A tie names the other candidates with the same fit ) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 206 Tm
(and as many missing capabilities, which would serve as well.) Tj
/F2 9 Tf
1 0 0 1 50 191 Tm
(Required changes and blockers. ) Tj
